>> title: Roast Chicken with Root Vegetables
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, roast
>> time: 1 hour 30 minutes

Heat the #oven{} to 200C.

Rub @chicken{1.6%kg} all over with @olive oil{2%tbsp}, @salt{1%tsp}, @black pepper{1%tsp} and @thyme{3%sprigs}.

Peel and chop @carrot{4}, @parsnip{2} and @potato{600%g} into large chunks, then scatter them in a #roasting tin{} with @garlic{4%cloves}.

Sit the chicken on the vegetables and roast for ~{80%minutes} until the juices run clear.

Rest the bird for ~{15%minutes} before carving.
